---
title: Apple Crumble
servings: 6
time: 1 hour
---

Peel and slice @apples{6} into a #baking dish{} and sprinkle with @cinnamon{1%tsp} and @sugar{50%g}.

Rub @cold butter{120%g} into @flour{180%g} and @brown sugar{80%g} until it looks like coarse crumbs.

Scatter the crumble over the fruit and bake at 180°C for ~{45%minutes}.
